OL,3,GNEWSAWoman fined for breeding puppies
OL,4,Awithout a licence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who bred and sold puppies from
OL,7,Fher home without a licence, despite
OL,8,Freceiving previous warnings, has been
OL,9,Fordered to pay #4,000.
OL,11,FEloise Templar admitted to selling
OL,12,Fhigh-value puppies, such as cavapoos,
OL,13,Funlicensed from her home in Frenchay,
OL,14,FBristol.
OL,16,FAn investigation launched by the
OL,17,FTrading Standards' Animal Health Team
OL,18,Ffound evidence of ongoing sales at the
OL,19,Fproperty, with each puppy being
OL,20,Fadvertised at a cost of about #1,400.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
