OL,3,GNEWSAWoman fined for breeding puppies
OL,4,Awithout a licence
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This prosecution sends a clear message
OL,7,Fthat we will take decisive action
OL,8,Fwherever there is evidence of poor
OL,9,Fanimal welfare standards and will
OL,10,Fpursue anyone who breeds and sells
OL,11,Fanimals without the appropriate
OL,12,Flicence," said councillor Stephen
OL,13,FWilliams.
